# RS2_1_to_TS2_1a
# RS2.1 (step_2_1_RS.pdb)  ->  TS2.1a (step_2_1_PS.pdb)
# Friedel-Crafts C-C sigma-bond formation between the iminium/enal chain and indole. The step_2_1_PS structure is used as the TS2.1a valence state.
#
# q atom (q)         PDB ID          LIB ID (resname.name)
# or neighbour (n)?  (resid.atom)    RS2.1          TS2.1a        
#
# STATE-ALIAS MODE: make sure your .lib residue names match these aliases.
# Component aliases:
#   ACE: R21A -> T21A
#   ENL: R21E -> T21E
#   IND: R21I -> T21I
#   NME: R21N -> T21N
#   PAF: R21P -> T21P
#   WA2: R212 -> T212
#   WAT: R21W -> T21W
#
q                   1.N2            R21P.N2          T21P.N2          # serial 1 PAF A1.N2
q                   1.C9            R21P.C9          T21P.C9          # serial 2 PAF A1.C9
q                   1.C7            R21P.C7          T21P.C7          # serial 3 PAF A1.C7
